      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنقّث</span></b>  <i>He endeavoured to make</i> a woman
<i>incline to him, and to render</i> her <i>affectionate to
him:</i> (K:) as though he drew forth her love,
like as one draws forth the marrow from a bone.
(TA.) ― 
